{"5130060":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Windowsill Isle","steam_appid":5130060,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Windowsill Isle<\/strong> is a small island that lives on your desktop.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It never goes fullscreen. It never asks for your attention.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It won't pop up while you're busy.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It just sits in the corner of your screen, quietly living its own life.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Look up every once in a while, and you'll find something has changed.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The sea leaves things behind<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every now and then, the tide leaves something on the sand.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A small anchor. A bottle. A piece of driftwood.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They aren't quests. Nothing is waiting on you.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's just the sea, thinking of you.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5130060\/extras\/21730c1b3092a227a144f4beb30d1664.avif?t=1793657605\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5130060\/extras_big\/21730c1b3092a227a144f4beb30d1664.webp?t=1793657605 width=1560 height=826 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Click, and you'll know what a place is for<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every building on the island has a name and a purpose.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click one to see who works there,<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and what the place means to the people who live here.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5130060\/extras\/818bdf86f326361f2843fd5058a2a3d8.avif?t=1793657605\" width=966 height=618 \/><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The islanders have names, and moods<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each one has their own job and their own temperament.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They don't wait for your orders.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They're simply living their lives.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5130060\/extras\/705687a1fee0d0c1e1345d5731329792.avif?t=1793657605\" width=1166 height=694 \/><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The lighthouse slowly comes alive<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the heart of the island stands a lighthouse.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While you work, while you type, while you click,<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >energy gathers, little by little.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The hours you spent focused become light on the island.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5130060\/extras\/0895e88028cfb9f776efbcb36c622083.avif?t=1793657605\" width=1130 height=731 \/><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The town grows on its own<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A house, a park, a fountain — the islanders want to build something.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you help?<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The island you leave today won't be quite the island you return to.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5130060\/extras\/6aaee754efa0686e907b29da56739f26.avif?t=1793657605\" width=1022 height=622 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Island Left You a Photograph<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The island keeps a record of moments worth remembering.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The lighthouse, its residents, and the changing light of each day—all find a place in your island album.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5130060\/extras\/f7074e16d4db95d1121f38a40c196cbf.avif?t=1793657605\" width=857 height=572 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Sea Keeps the Little Things You Missed<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some events you didn’t happen to see may become messages in bottles and drift back to shore.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They aren’t notifications. It’s simply the island sharing something that once happened.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5130060\/extras\/6aa5085292cc33e924c9328c55fca740.avif?t=1793657605\" width=1075 height=587 \/><\/span><\/p>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Windowsill Isle<\/strong> is a small island that lives on your desktop.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It never goes fullscreen. It never asks for your attention.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It won't pop up while you're busy.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It just sits in the corner of your screen, quietly living its own life.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Look up every once in a while, and you'll find something has changed.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The sea leaves things behind<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every now and then, the tide leaves something on the sand.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A small anchor. A bottle. A piece of driftwood.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They aren't quests. Nothing is waiting on you.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's just the sea, thinking of you.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5130060\/extras\/21730c1b3092a227a144f4beb30d1664.avif?t=1793657605\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5130060\/extras_big\/21730c1b3092a227a144f4beb30d1664.webp?t=1793657605 width=1560 height=826 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Click, and you'll know what a place is for<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every building on the island has a name and a purpose.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click one to see who works there,<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and what the place means to the people who live here.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5130060\/extras\/818bdf86f326361f2843fd5058a2a3d8.avif?t=1793657605\" width=966 height=618 \/><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The islanders have names, and moods<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each one has their own job and their own temperament.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They don't wait for your orders.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They're simply living their lives.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5130060\/extras\/705687a1fee0d0c1e1345d5731329792.avif?t=1793657605\" width=1166 height=694 \/><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The lighthouse slowly comes alive<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the heart of the island stands a lighthouse.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While you work, while you type, while you click,<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >energy gathers, little by little.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The hours you spent focused become light on the island.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5130060\/extras\/0895e88028cfb9f776efbcb36c622083.avif?t=1793657605\" width=1130 height=731 \/><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The town grows on its own<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A house, a park, a fountain — the islanders want to build something.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you help?<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The island you leave today won't be quite the island you return to.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5130060\/extras\/6aaee754efa0686e907b29da56739f26.avif?t=1793657605\" width=1022 height=622 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Island Left You a Photograph<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The island keeps a record of moments worth remembering.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The lighthouse, its residents, and the changing light of each day—all find a place in your island album.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5130060\/extras\/f7074e16d4db95d1121f38a40c196cbf.avif?t=1793657605\" width=857 height=572 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Sea Keeps the Little Things You Missed<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some events you didn’t happen to see may become messages in bottles and drift back to shore.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They aren’t notifications. It’s simply the island sharing something that once happened.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5130060\/extras\/6aa5085292cc33e924c9328c55fca740.avif?t=1793657605\" width=1075 height=587 \/><\/span><\/p>","short_description":"A tiny voxel island lives quietly in the corner of your desktop. Its residents go about their days on their own; tides roll in, the lighthouse comes on at dusk, letters wash ashore. While you're at your computer it stays awake; step away and it slowly drifts off. Nothing to manage, nothing to lose.","supported_languages":"English, Japanese, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Korean","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5130060\/30c7a86f1f7bb30ce72ad4ea73a0f6c0643ef1b8\/header.jpg?t=1793657605","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5130060\/a07571fb5ec35fe8753874715967a93fc36c80d8\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1793657605","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5130060\/a07571fb5ec35fe8753874715967a93fc36c80d8\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1793657605","website":null,"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Any modern 64-bit processor<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 2048 MB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> Integrated graphics with Vulkan support<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 500 MB available space<\/li><\/ul>"},"mac_requirements":[],"linux_requirements":[],"developers":["7382Team"],"publishers":["7382Team"],"price_overview":{"currency":"EUR","initial":519,"final":467,"discount_percent":10,"initial_formatted":"5,19€","final_formatted":"4,67€"},"packages":[1776808],"package_groups":[{"name":"default","title":"Buy Windowsill Isle","description":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","save_text":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","subs":[{"packageid":1776808,"percent_savings_text":"-10% ","percent_savings":0,"option_text":"Windowsill Isle - <span class=\"discount_original_price\">5,19€<\/span> 4,67€","option_description":"","can_get_free_license":"0","is_free_license":false,"price_in_cents_with_discount":467}]}],"platforms":{"windows":true,"mac":false,"linux":false},"categories":[{"id":2,"description":"Single-player"},{"id":22,"description":"Steam Achievements"},{"id":67,"description":"Camera Comfort"},{"id":76,"description":"Mouse Only Option"},{"id":80,"description":"#category_playable_at_your_own_pace"},{"id":74,"description":"Playable without Timed Input"},{"id":79,"description":"Save Anytime"},{"id":23,"description":"Steam Cloud"},{"id":62,"description":"Family Sharing"}],"genres":[{"id":"23","description":"Indie"}],"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5130060\/d01823616b7d320bd15d32f3df43aa498f4f1f57\/ss_d01823616b7d320bd15d32f3df43aa498f4f1f57.600x338.jpg?t=1793657605","path_full":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5130060\/d01823616b7d320bd15d32f3df43aa498f4f1f57\/ss_d01823616b7d320bd15d32f3df43aa498f4f1f57.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793657605"},{"id":1,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5130060\/e03ecc48d610c8c5f64d3df855c622e8502fef2c\/ss_e03ecc48d610c8c5f64d3df855c622e8502fef2c.600x338.jpg?t=1793657605","path_full":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5130060\/e03ecc48d610c8c5f64d3df855c622e8502fef2c\/ss_e03ecc48d610c8c5f64d3df855c622e8502fef2c.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793657605"},{"id":2,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5130060\/8363370e21091ca77dfa4fdb74e3b982c1fa10c1\/ss_8363370e21091ca77dfa4fdb74e3b982c1fa10c1.600x338.jpg?t=1793657605","path_full":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5130060\/8363370e21091ca77dfa4fdb74e3b982c1fa10c1\/ss_8363370e21091ca77dfa4fdb74e3b982c1fa10c1.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793657605"},{"id":3,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5130060\/39924cf291e23d751ac9e3bf35df2535e2766688\/ss_39924cf291e23d751ac9e3bf35df2535e2766688.600x338.jpg?t=1793657605","path_full":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5130060\/39924cf291e23d751ac9e3bf35df2535e2766688\/ss_39924cf291e23d751ac9e3bf35df2535e2766688.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793657605"},{"id":4,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5130060\/4cd92b8c55ec1aa9245175a81d20462ac74d82a3\/ss_4cd92b8c55ec1aa9245175a81d20462ac74d82a3.600x338.jpg?t=1793657605","path_full":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5130060\/4cd92b8c55ec1aa9245175a81d20462ac74d82a3\/ss_4cd92b8c55ec1aa9245175a81d20462ac74d82a3.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793657605"}],"movies":[{"id":257407827,"name":"Windowsill Isle – Official Gameplay Trailer","thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/257407827\/8ec7ac98d2e2a8793aef0cd6da2104f317a5b7d2\/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1787634525","dash_av1":"https:\/\/video.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_trailers\/5130060\/1174052202\/ad6a2c7f7ebdfe66b479f31326fc81aca121b8d9\/1787634319\/dash_av1.mpd?t=1787634525","dash_h264":"https:\/\/video.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_trailers\/5130060\/1174052202\/ad6a2c7f7ebdfe66b479f31326fc81aca121b8d9\/1787634319\/dash_h264.mpd?t=1787634525","hls_h264":"https:\/\/video.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_trailers\/5130060\/1174052202\/ad6a2c7f7ebdfe66b479f31326fc81aca121b8d9\/1787634319\/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1787634525","highlight":true}],"achievements":{"total":27,"highlighted":[{"icon":"3618f715538f2ea6ae172cd298e4f5bb24e485f6.jpg","localized_name":"Two Hours","archived":0,"hidden":0,"name":"Two Hours","path":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/community_assets\/images\/apps\/5130060\/3618f715538f2ea6ae172cd298e4f5bb24e485f6.jpg"},{"icon":"6d9abda86bbf552a8b3c60220285d02e65a88997.jpg","localized_name":"Ten Hours","archived":0,"hidden":0,"name":"Ten Hours","path":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/community_assets\/images\/apps\/5130060\/6d9abda86bbf552a8b3c60220285d02e65a88997.jpg"},{"icon":"3568f353cf34906ba59489661453d23d592ae7b5.jpg","localized_name":"Forty Hours","archived":0,"hidden":1,"name":"Forty Hours","path":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/community_assets\/images\/apps\/5130060\/3568f353cf34906ba59489661453d23d592ae7b5.jpg"},{"icon":"08e749af29bfddfaec493b460acebbfbdf5198db.jpg","localized_name":"A Hundred and Fifty","archived":0,"hidden":1,"name":"A Hundred and Fifty","path":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/community_assets\/images\/apps\/5130060\/08e749af29bfddfaec493b460acebbfbdf5198db.jpg"},{"icon":"b0c4e49af402316620414db02be6cde4f884aa3b.jpg","localized_name":"Five Hundred Hours","archived":0,"hidden":1,"name":"Five Hundred Hours","path":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/community_assets\/images\/apps\/5130060\/b0c4e49af402316620414db02be6cde4f884aa3b.jpg"},{"icon":"27d648d26b26f1930a64a68862af3100715cddae.jpg","localized_name":"Seven Days","archived":0,"hidden":1,"name":"Seven Days","path":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/community_assets\/images\/apps\/5130060\/27d648d26b26f1930a64a68862af3100715cddae.jpg"},{"icon":"8eeeff6240cfe19299973ef46273b3c11289163a.jpg","localized_name":"A Month of Mornings","archived":0,"hidden":1,"name":"A Month of Mornings","path":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/community_assets\/images\/apps\/5130060\/8eeeff6240cfe19299973ef46273b3c11289163a.jpg"},{"icon":"3602a6019bc921320c55b59d99a7e34cfbb7f6cf.jpg","localized_name":"Someone Left","archived":0,"hidden":1,"name":"Someone Left","path":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/community_assets\/images\/apps\/5130060\/3602a6019bc921320c55b59d99a7e34cfbb7f6cf.jpg"},{"icon":"ebd98114b155a62237ab48a7563c66c01518b0bf.jpg","localized_name":"Someone Came Home","archived":0,"hidden":1,"name":"Someone Came Home","path":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/community_assets\/images\/apps\/5130060\/ebd98114b155a62237ab48a7563c66c01518b0bf.jpg"},{"icon":"401fd6fabab5585e16b1cd0793dc3ba3d1f64eb9.jpg","localized_name":"A Letter Came","archived":0,"hidden":1,"name":"A Letter Came","path":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/community_assets\/images\/apps\/5130060\/401fd6fabab5585e16b1cd0793dc3ba3d1f64eb9.jpg"}]},"release_date":{"coming_soon":false,"date":"2 Nov, 2026"},"support_info":{"url":"","email":"engchrisvideo@gmail.com"},"background":"https:\/\/store.akamai.steamstatic.com\/images\/storepagebackground\/app\/5130060?t=1793657605","background_raw":"https:\/\/store.akamai.steamstatic.com\/images\/storepagebackground\/app\/5130060?t=1793657605","content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"ratings":{"dejus":{"rating_generated":"1","rating":"l","required_age":"0","banned":"0","use_age_gate":"0","descriptors":""},"steam_germany":{"rating_generated":"1","rating":"0","required_age":"0","banned":"0","use_age_gate":"0","descriptors":""},"igrs":{"rating_generated":"1","rating":"3","required_age":"0","banned":"0","use_age_gate":"0","descriptors":""}}}}}